<title>USA: America Online, Osborne/McGraw Hill in pact.</title>
<headline>America Online, Osborne/McGraw Hill in pact.</headline>
<dateline>BERKELEY, Calif. 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Osborne/McGraw-Hill, a division of the McGraw-Hill Cos, said Tuesday it agreed to a publishing pact with America Online Inc to publish the AOL's official Internet guide and future additional titles.</p>
<p>Under the agreement, the AOL guide will be sold and marketed by Osborne/McGraw-Hill through its retail and distribution channels while AOL will sell the book through its online bookstore.</p>
<p>Further details of the deal were not disclosed.</p>
</text>
